{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Someone needs to be arrested for this, people are getting worried. ","#","^speaker: Nick ","/#","#","^portrait:nick ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^Again, its another crime scene with no evidence left behind. ","#","^speaker: Debra ","/#","#","^portrait:Debra ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^Whoever this person is knows how to cover up. You dont think it they could be law enforcment?? ","#","^speaker: Debra ","/#","#","^portrait:Debra ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^Calm down","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^One of us?","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Calm down you two. There is no way its one of us ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"CalmDown"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ You think it could be one of us? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"OneOfUs"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["done",{"#f":5}]}],"done",{"OneOfUs":[["^Dont say these things Debra. We need to keep faith within the community. ","#","^speaker: Nick ","/#","#","^portrait:nick ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^As far as they need to know, we have this under control and are closing in. ","#","^speaker: Nick ","/#","#","^portrait:nick ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^Debras' right","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Nicks' right","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ Nick she has a point. They've been one step ahead of us this whole time ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"DebraRight"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ You're right, we need to focus on finding the real culprit ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"NickRight"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"DebraRight":[["^No. She does not. I trust everyone here. And we are done talking about this subject. ","#","^speaker: Nick ","/#","#","^portrait:nick ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^We stay focused, lets look over what we have again. ","#","^speaker: Nick ","/#","#","^portrait:nick ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^The Library","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Animals","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^The Murder","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ The Library, what could it mean? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"TheLibrary"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ The animals, what could they mean? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"Animals"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["^ Why a person? why now? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"TheMurder"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"NickRight":[["^Im sorry, its just this has me so stressed out. What do we do? ","#","^speaker: Debra ","/#","#","^portrait:Debra ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^We stay focused, lets look over what we have again. ","#","^speaker: Nick ","/#","#","^portrait:nick ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","ev","str","^The Library","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Animals","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^The Murder","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ The Library, what could it mean? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"TheLibrary"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ The animals, what could they mean? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"Animals"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["^ Why a person? why now? ","#","^speaker: Marcus ","/#","#","^portrait:marcus ","/#","#","^layout:left","/#","\n",{"->":"TheMurder"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"CalmDown":[["^Im sorry, its just this has me so stressed out. What do we do? ","#","^speaker: Debra ","/#","#","^port